MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 REM compare math-unit and software FP paths
>20 E%=0:N%=0
>30 FOR I%=1 TO 200
>40 A=RND(1)*10^(RND(20)-10):B=RND(1)*10^(RND(20)-10)
>45 IF RND(2)=1 THEN A=-A
>50 ?&AF=&80+(I% AND 1):Q1=A/B:M1=A*B:S1=A+B
>60 ?&AF=1:Q2=A/B:M2=A*B:S2=A+B
>70 ?&AF=0
>80 IF Q1<>Q2 OR M1<>M2 OR S1<>S2 THEN E%+=1:PRINT A,B,Q1,Q2
>90 N%+=1
>100 NEXT
>110 PRINT N%;" random pairs, ";E%;" mismatches"
>120 PRINT 2^-1, 2^-2, 10^-3, 3^3, 2^31, 2^0.5
>RUN
       200 random pairs, 0 mismatches
       0.5      0.25      1E-3        272.14748365E9        1.41421356
>NEW
>10 REM same comparison with deliberately wrong hardware quotient estimates
>20 E%=0
>30 FOR I%=1 TO 200
>40 A=RND(1)*10^(RND(20)-10):B=RND(1)*10^(RND(20)-10)
>50 ?&AF=&80+(I% AND 1):Q1=A/B:S1=SQR(A)
>60 ?&AF=1:Q2=A/B:S2=SQR(A)
>70 ?&AF=0:IF Q1<>Q2 OR S1<>S2 THEN E%+=1
>80 NEXT
>90 PRINT "perturbed estimates: ";E%;" mismatches"
>RUN
perturbed estimates: 0 mismatches
>
